  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "This is McNamara. I'll be brief because the situation is moving fast.\n\r\nOn
    January 30th, the North Vietnamese and Viet Cong launched coordinated attacks
    on more than a hundred cities and towns across South Vietnam. In Saigon, enemy
    units got inside the embassy compound and hit key government buildings. In Hue,
    they took most of the city \u2014 and we now have reports they executed thousands
    of civilians before our forces drove them out. Our people repelled the attacks,
    and enemy casualties are high. But I want to be absolutely clear on this point:
    the scope of these operations was not anticipated. The fighting has been intense,
    and American casualties are significant."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 32091826b8c824c4980c24d53d802587, type: 2}
